{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09836","headline":"春寻河阳陶处士别业 · 岑参","name":"春寻河阳陶处士别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风煖日暾暾，黄鹂飞近村。\n花明潘子县，柳暗陶公门。\n药椀摇山影，鱼竿带水痕。\n南桥车马客，何事苦喧喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}